<html>
<head>
  <title>Philly Budget Data</title>
  <%- include('_meta', { basePath: '' }) %>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('_menu') %>
<main>
   <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 pb-16 text-center lg:pt-32">
      <h1 class="mx-auto italic max-w-4xl font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-7xl">
      Philly <span class="text-blue-800">Budget</span> Data
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-700">
      This website provides both visualizations of the Philadelphia city budget as well as raw budget data from 2016 - 2026.</p>
   </div>
   <section class="bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-32">
     <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Open Budget bubble charts</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-700">The following visualisations are built off the the City of Philadelphia's <a class="text-blue-800" href="https://github.com/CityOfPhiladelphia/open-budget">open budget</a> implementation, based on a project by <a class="text-blue-800" href="https://github.com/tpreusse/open-budget">OpenData.ch</a>, the Swiss division of the <a class="text-blue-800" href="http://okfn.org/" rel="nofollow">Open Knowledge Foundation</a>.</p></div>
        <div class="lg:mt-20 mt-8 lg:block">
          <div class="grid grid-row md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 grid-cols-1 justify-items-center" role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal">
              <div class="relative">
                <a href="charts/bubble/2027.ejs">
                  <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2027-proposed.jpg" />
                  <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2027 Proposed Budget</h3>
                </a>
              </div>
              <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100">
                <a href="charts/bubble/2027-by-fund.ejs">
                  <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2027-proposed-by-fund.jpg" />
                  <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2027 Proposed Budget by Funding Source</h3>
                </a>
              </div>
              <div class="relative opacity-75 hover:opacity-100">
                <a href="charts/bubble/2019.ejs">
                  <img class="h-85" src="assets/images/2018-proposed-by-fund.jpg" />
                  <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-slate-900 text-xl">2018 Proposed Budget by Funding Source</h3>
                </a>
              </div>              
          </div>
        </div>
   </section>
   <section class="py-20 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
        <h2 id="about" class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">About this website</h2>
        <p>coming soon!</p>
        <p><a href="https://thenounproject.com/icon/budget-7824210/">Budget icon from the noun project.</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
        <h2 id="budget" class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">About Philly's Budget</h2>
        <p>coming soon!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="py-20 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl md:text-center">
        <h2 id="resources" class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Resources</h2>
        <p>coming soon!</p>
        <p><a style="display: block; background-color: hsl(243.4, 52.2%, 13.1%); padding: 20px;" href="https://www.peoplesbudgetoffice.org/"><img elementtiming="nbf-header-logo-desktop" src="//images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/67c20a8b415097680ba6a095/dda629c2-96fc-462b-a8cf-7ae4cdfacf98/PBO_Logo_White_Red.png?format=1500w" alt="People&amp;#39;s Budget Office " style="display:block" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-loader="raw"></a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
   </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>